  "notes": [
    "Blue-ink sheet headed Carte trouée, foliation 10, no date. It gives conditions on (X⊃K), a cut-space condition involving standard punctured disks, and a combinatorial polygon description of Dn*. The lower two-thirds contain polygon, line, circle and graph drawings, with labels σ0,σ1,σ2, E, Déc(hat X,ω) and tilde X−F. These definitions and sketches are reported rather than proved.",
    "The component sentence has a colon-shaped pair of ink marks where both witnesses supplied à. The spelling standart, singular est homéomorphe, abbreviated Tte/comb./ép., colon before the polygon tuple and open-left interval ]0,1] are retained. The last tuple letter is R. The upper fan is copied with thirteen interior strokes and its visible gaps; the bottom graph loses the extra edge that C had introduced. No mathematical inference is used to fill or complete either drawing."
  ],
